---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Beyond Do It Again — Faloe Foundry"
  description="A directing actors workshop from Faloe Foundry. Five sessions. Ten hours. A cohort of twelve working filmmakers."
>

  <!-- ─── NAV ─────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <header class="fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 z-50 flex items-center justify-between" style="background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.98) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.85) 80%, transparent 100%); backdrop-filter: blur(4px);">
    <div class="w-full max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-20 py-3 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="/" class="text-[#fdfcf8] uppercase select-none" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.3em;">
        Faloe
      </a>
      <span class="text-[11px] uppercase font-light text-[#c8c5bc]" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.1em;">
        Foundry &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Workshop
      </span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- ─── HERO ──────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="py-12" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #1e1e1e; padding-top: 72px;">
    <div class="max-w-[720px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-20">

      <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-light mb-10" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #B8963E;">
        Faloe Foundry &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Summer 2026
      </p>

      <h1
        class="font-light text-[#fdfcf8] leading-[0.92] mb-8"
        style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6rem); letter-spacing: -0.04em;"
      >
        Beyond Do It Again
      </h1>

      <p class="font-light text-[#fdfcf8] mb-14" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.5vw, 1.85rem); letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-style: italic; opacity: 0.72;">
        A directing actors workshop
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-5">
        <p class="font-light text-[#c8c5bc] leading-[1.85]" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.01em;">
          &ldquo;Do it again&rdquo; is not a note. It is the absence of one. It means you do not yet know what you want, or you do not know how to ask for it.
        </p>
        <p class="font-light text-[#c8c5bc] leading-[1.85]" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.01em;">
          This workshop is about changing that.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── THE WORK ──────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="py-12" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #1e1e1e;">
    <div class="max-w-[720px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-20">

      <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-light mb-10" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #B8963E;">
        The Work
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-5">
        <p class="font-light text-[#c8c5bc] leading-[1.85]" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.01em;">
          Directing a performance is a specific skill. It has a language, a logic, and a set of tools that can be learned. Most filmmakers never learn them. They rely on instinct, on charm, on the hope that a good actor figures it out.
        </p>
        <p class="font-light text-[#c8c5bc] leading-[1.85]" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.01em;">
          Sometimes that works. When it doesn&rsquo;t, they say: do it again.
        </p>
        <p class="font-light text-[#c8c5bc] leading-[1.85]" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.01em;">
          Five sessions. Ten hours. A cohort of twelve working filmmakers who want to become more precise and more useful in the room with an actor.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── WHO THIS IS FOR ───────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="py-12" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #1e1e1e;">
    <div class="max-w-[720px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-20">

      <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-light mb-10" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #B8963E;">
        Who This Is For
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-5">
        <p class="font-light text-[#c8c5bc] leading-[1.85]" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.01em;">
          Directors who have been on set and know the feeling of not knowing what to say. Writers directing their own work for the first time. Filmmakers who want to stop hoping for a good take and start knowing how to get one.
        </p>
        <p class="font-light text-[#c8c5bc] leading-[1.85]" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.01em;">
          Not for beginners to filmmaking. For filmmakers who are beginners to this.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── THE CURRICULUM ────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="py-12" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #1e1e1e;">
    <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-20">

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_320px] gap-12 lg:gap-20 xl:gap-32">

        <!-- Left: label + items -->
        <div>

          <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-light mb-16" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #B8963E;">
            The Curriculum
          </p>

          <div>

            <div class="py-8 grid grid-cols-[3.5rem_1fr] gap-6 items-start" style="border-top: 1px solid #1e1e1e;">
              <p class="text-[12px] uppercase font-light pt-1" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #B8963E; letter-spacing: 0.1em;">[&nbsp;I&nbsp;]</p>
              <div>
                <p class="font-light text-[#fdfcf8] mb-3 leading-tight" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 1.6rem); letter-spacing: -0.01em;">The Director&rsquo;s Toolkit</p>
                <p class="font-light text-[#c8c5bc] leading-[1.85]" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.01em;">What you are actually doing when you direct a performance. Intention, objective, obstacle. The language that opens an actor up rather than shuts them down.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="py-8 grid grid-cols-[3.5rem_1fr] gap-6 items-start" style="border-top: 1px solid #1e1e1e;">
              <p class="text-[12px] uppercase font-light pt-1" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #B8963E; letter-spacing: 0.1em;">[&nbsp;II&nbsp;]</p>
              <div>
                <p class="font-light text-[#fdfcf8] mb-3 leading-tight" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 1.6rem); letter-spacing: -0.01em;">Text and Beats</p>
                <p class="font-light text-[#c8c5bc] leading-[1.85]" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.01em;">Script analysis from the director&rsquo;s chair. What the scene is really about underneath the words. How to find the turn.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="py-8 grid grid-cols-[3.5rem_1fr] gap-6 items-start" style="border-top: 1px solid #1e1e1e;">
              <p class="text-[12px] uppercase font-light pt-1" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #B8963E; letter-spacing: 0.1em;">[&nbsp;III&nbsp;]</p>
              <div>
                <p class="font-light text-[#fdfcf8] mb-3 leading-tight" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 1.6rem); letter-spacing: -0.01em;">Blocking and Rehearsal</p>
                <p class="font-light text-[#c8c5bc] leading-[1.85]" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.01em;">How to use space. How to run a productive rehearsal. How to give a note that moves something forward rather than backward.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="py-8 grid grid-cols-[3.5rem_1fr] gap-6 items-start" style="border-top: 1px solid #1e1e1e; border-bottom: 1px solid #1e1e1e;">
              <p class="text-[12px] uppercase font-light pt-1 leading-snug" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #B8963E; letter-spacing: 0.1em;">[&nbsp;IV&nbsp;+&nbsp;V&nbsp;]</p>
              <div>
                <p class="font-light text-[#fdfcf8] mb-3 leading-tight" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 1.6rem); letter-spacing: -0.01em;">Practicum</p>
                <p class="font-light text-[#c8c5bc] leading-[1.85]" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.01em;">Each participant directs two others in a prepared scene. The group watches. We work through it together. This is where it lands.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Right: supporting detail -->
        <div class="hidden lg:flex flex-col justify-end pb-8">
          <div class="space-y-8" style="border-left: 1px solid #1e1e1e; padding-left: 2rem;">
            <div>
              <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase font-light mb-2" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #B8963E;">Sessions</p>
              <p class="font-light text-[#fdfcf8]" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 2.75rem); letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1;">Five</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase font-light mb-2" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #B8963E;">Total Hours</p>
              <p class="font-light text-[#fdfcf8]" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 2.75rem); letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1;">Ten</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase font-light mb-2" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #B8963E;">Cohort Size</p>
              <p class="font-light text-[#fdfcf8]" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 2.75rem); letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1;">Twelve</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── WHAT YOU LEAVE WITH ───────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="py-12" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #1e1e1e;">
    <div class="max-w-[720px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-20">

      <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-light mb-10" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #B8963E;">
        What You Leave With
      </p>

      <p class="font-light text-[#c8c5bc] leading-[1.85]" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.01em;">
        A language and methodology you can take into any room, on any project. Recorded access to all five sessions, including footage of your own practicum work to study at your own pace. A cohort of twelve filmmakers who were in it with you.
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── THE DETAILS ────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="py-12" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #1e1e1e;">
    <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-20">

      <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-light mb-16" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #B8963E;">
        The Details
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-14 md:gap-16">

        <!-- Schedule -->
        <div>
          <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase font-light mb-6" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #B8963E;">
            Schedule
          </p>
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <p class="font-light text-[#c8c5bc] leading-[1.85]" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;">June 15 &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Session I</p>
            <p class="font-light text-[#c8c5bc] leading-[1.85]" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;">June 22 &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Session II</p>
            <p class="font-light text-[#c8c5bc] leading-[1.85]" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;">June 29 &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Session III</p>
            <p class="font-light text-[#c8c5bc] leading-[1.85]" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;">July 7 &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Session IV</p>
            <p class="font-light text-[#c8c5bc] leading-[1.85]" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;">July 8 &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Session V</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Time -->
        <div>
          <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase font-light mb-6" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #B8963E;">
            Time
          </p>
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <p class="font-light text-[#c8c5bc] leading-[1.85]" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;">Noon to 2pm ET</p>
            <p class="font-light text-[#c8c5bc] leading-[1.85]" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;">9am Los Angeles</p>
            <p class="font-light text-[#c8c5bc] leading-[1.85]" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;">5pm London</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Format -->
        <div>
          <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase font-light mb-6" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #B8963E;">
            Format
          </p>
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <p class="font-light text-[#c8c5bc] leading-[1.85]" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;">Virtual</p>
            <p class="font-light text-[#c8c5bc] leading-[1.85]" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;">Twelve participants maximum</p>
            <p class="font-light text-[#c8c5bc] leading-[1.85]" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;">Two hours per session</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Investment -->
        <div>
          <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase font-light mb-6" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #B8963E;">
            Investment
          </p>
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-4">
              <span class="font-light text-[#fdfcf8]" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1;">$450</span>
              <span class="font-light text-[#c8c5bc]" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;">First six spots</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-4">
              <span class="font-light text-[#fdfcf8]" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1;">$575</span>
              <span class="font-light text-[#c8c5bc]" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;">Remaining spots</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── THE TEACHER ────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="py-12" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #1e1e1e;">
    <div class="max-w-[720px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-20">

      <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-light mb-12" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #B8963E;">
        The Teacher
      </p>

      <p class="font-light text-[#fdfcf8] leading-[1.35] mb-12" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.5vw, 1.85rem); letter-spacing: -0.02em;">
        Jonathan Whittaker has taught directing actors across workshop and production contexts for years and used the same toolkit on set. This course is not a theory of directing performance. It is a practice, built from what actually happens in a rehearsal room, in the moment when an actor looks at you and waits.
      </p>

      <div style="border: 1px solid #1e1e1e; padding: 1.5rem 2rem;">
        <p class="font-light text-[#c8c5bc] leading-[1.85]" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.01em;">
          All five sessions are recorded. Participants receive access to the full archive, including their own practicum footage.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── CTA ────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="max-w-[720px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-20">

      <p class="font-light text-[#c8c5bc] mb-8 italic" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.02em;">
        Cohort size is twelve. When it&rsquo;s full, it&rsquo;s full.
      </p>

      <a
        href="https://tally.so/r/VLbLPa"
        class="cta-outline inline-block text-[12px] font-light uppercase px-8 py-4"
        style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.15em;"
      >
        RESERVE YOUR SPOT
      </a>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── FOOTER ─────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <footer class="py-12 border-t border-[#fdfcf8] border-opacity-10">
    <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-20">

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-8">
        <span class="text-[#fdfcf8] opacity-60" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.2em;">
          Faloe
        </span>
        <div class="flex gap-8 text-[13px] uppercase font-light text-[#c8c5bc] opacity-60" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.2em;">
          <span>New York</span>
          <span>&copy; 2026</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="border-t border-[#fdfcf8] border-opacity-5 pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-end justify-between gap-6">
        <p class="text-[13px] font-light text-[#c8c5bc] opacity-60 leading-[1.8] max-w-lg" style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.02em;">
          <span class="uppercase" style="letter-spacing: 0.15em;">In Network</span>
          &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp;
          Strategic partnerships with industry-leading post-production houses and virtual stages are currently under finalization.
        </p>
        <p class="flex-shrink-0 opacity-70" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; color: #B8963E; letter-spacing: 0.01em;">
          A Film. Not Content.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </footer>

</Layout>

<style>
  /* CTA outline button */
  .cta-outline {
    border: 1px solid #B8963E;
    color: #B8963E;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
  }
  .cta-outline:hover {
    background-color: #B8963E;
    color: #0c0a07;
  }

  /* Keyboard focus styles */
  a:focus-visible,
  button:focus-visible {
    outline: 1px solid #fdfcf8;
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }

  /* Respect reduced motion */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .cta-outline {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
